  "description": "Yu Seolu is an anomaly of an omega with no pheromones, which is why he never expects any alpha to show interest in him. Certainly not a royal alpha like Baek Doha, any less. But once he’s caught Doha’s attention, Seolu can’t seem to escape from it. And then one night, after he finds himself pregnant with Doha’s child, Seolu finds the chance to flee from Doha’s obsession once and for all… \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
